From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: prospero-win <prospero-win@invalid>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 03:00:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] kernelbase: Read the launcher helper's pid and image as the
 process starts.

Patch 1023 read PW_LAUNCHER_PID and PW_LAUNCHER_IMAGE the first time a
module query asked about another process, from the environment as it was
then. A game may change its environment before its launcher check runs;
read both once while kernelbase starts instead.
---
 dlls/kernelbase/debug.c | 7 +++++++
 1 file changed, 7 insertions(+)

diff --git a/dlls/kernelbase/debug.c b/dlls/kernelbase/debug.c
index b166556e87..65807780ec 100644
--- a/dlls/kernelbase/debug.c
+++ b/dlls/kernelbase/debug.c
@@ -677,9 +677,16 @@
  * WINE_PS5_NTDLL_DIR; it is read at start, not on the crash path. */
 static BOOL no_debugger;
 
+static DWORD pw_launcher_pid(void);
+static const WCHAR *pw_launcher_image(void);
+
 void init_debugger(void)
 {
     no_debugger = GetEnvironmentVariableW( L"WINE_PS5_NTDLL_DIR", NULL, 0 ) > 0;
+    /* The launcher helper's pid and image, read once as the process starts:
+     * a game may change its environment before its launcher check runs. */
+    pw_launcher_pid();
+    pw_launcher_image();
 }
 
 
